== Biography

I'm a Ph.D. student at the [http://www.cse.cuhk.edu.hk Department of Computer Science and Engineering],  
[http://www.cuhk.edu.hk/english/index.html The Chinese University of Hong Kong (CUHK)], 
under the supervision of [http://www.cse.cuhk.edu.hk/~byu/ Prof. Bei Yu] since Fall 2025.
Previously, I received my Bachelor degree from [https://www.bit.edu.cn/ Beijing Institute of Technology] in 2021,
and Master of Engineering from [http://www.ustc.edu.cn/ University of Science and Technology of China (USTC)] in 2024.

My research interests include LLM Applications and Computer Architecture.

